{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026MJcpFgCrb41795419170.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>受東北季候風影響，本港明日逐步轉涼。天文台預測周三、周四，市區氣溫最低16度。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-1530.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DbKlAIgpOS1795418942.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>在中環海濱風勢清勁，市民和旅客穿上厚外套、毛衣保暖。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-1530_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ScVAqgCHFk1795419187.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>一股東北季候風會在明早影響廣東沿岸，預料本港會轉吹偏北強風，周三及周四早晚清涼，市區最低氣溫在16度左右，新界再低兩、三度。</p><p></p><p>隨著東北季候風緩和及雲帶轉薄，本周後期天色逐漸好轉，氣溫又再回升。預料一股較乾燥的東北季候風補充，會在周末影響華南沿岸，屆時日夜溫差頗大。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.478234+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T09:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:15.075935+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:15.851738+00:00","content_hash":"300cbda39fbd3b007b870db577d3d20fb60ff8f0ba6786c4d732e36c1f209021","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.478234+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}